        <remarks>
          <para>Rename the devices shown in the list, using specific bytes from the raw advertisement data (ScanRecord.getBytes) in hexadecimal format, as well as a custom prefix/suffix around them Note that the prefix length is limited to BluetoothLeDeviceFilter.getRenamePrefixLengthLimit() characters to ensure that there's enough space to display the byte data The range of bytes to be displayed cannot be empty</para>
